Announcement that due to the Martin Luther King Jr. Holiday on Monday, January 19, 2026, the regularly scheduled City Council Committee meetings will instead be held in City Council Chambers, 2101 O’Neil Avenue, Cheyenne, WY, and via electronic conference meeting as follows: Public Services Committee will meet Tuesday, January 20, 2026 at Noon and Finance Committee will meet Wednesday, January 21, 2026 at Noon.
c)
Announcement of a Special Meeting to be held January 23, 2026 at 12:00 p.m. in City Council Chambers, 2101 O’Neil Avenue, Cheyenne, WY, and via electronic conference meeting to consider the transfer of ownership of retail liquor license application filed with the City Clerk’s Office for Westby Edge LLC d/b/a Westby Edge Brewing, 714 W. 20th St., Cheyenne, WY (license currently held by Scooters Scoreboard Inc.).
d)
Announcement that a Committee of the Whole meeting will be held on Wednesday, January 14, 2026 at 6:00 p.m. in City Council Chambers, 2101 O’Neil Avenue, Cheyenne, WY, and via electronic conference meeting.
